    "content": "All Surgical Procedures Carry Risks Including:\nInfection\nBleeding/hematoma\nAdverse anesthesia reactions\nNerve injury (temporary or permanent)\n\nAsymmetry\nUnsatisfactory aesthetic result\nNeed for revision surgery\nScarring\nBlood clots\nProcedure-Specific Risks:\nJaw surgery: Malocclusion, TMJ problems, relapse\nOrbital surgery: Double vision, blindness (rare)\nNasal surgery: Breathing difficulty, septal perforation\nImplants: Infection, shifting, extrusion\nFat grafting: Resorption, asymmetry, calcification"
